Dariya Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from movie Baar Baar Dekho sung by Arko.

Strumming Pattern : D UUD UUD

Capo on 1st fret

For Without Capo : Replace G to G#, Am to A#m, C to C#, D to D#, Em to Fm

